1230
01:06:58,880 --> 01:06:59,440
[SPEAKER_00] That's a big man.

1231
01:06:59,840 --> 01:07:03,200
[SPEAKER_02] Ajde, demla bit, isto, gdje je noti ta stvar.

1232
01:07:03,440 --> 01:07:03,760
[SPEAKER_02] Aha.

1233
01:07:03,920 --> 01:07:06,480
[SPEAKER_02] Protiv sebe on je od početka albuma.

1234
01:07:06,720 --> 01:07:09,040
[SPEAKER_02] Da, negdje od onog drugog, trećeg pisma što smo snimili.

1235
01:07:09,680 --> 01:07:10,320
[SPEAKER_02] Da, baš je.

1236
01:07:10,560 --> 01:07:12,960
[SPEAKER_03] Da želi taj bit, da čuje, da želi da to odradimoim na vama.

1237
