[SPEAKER_00] Jest, je.

1246
01:07:43,120 --> 01:07:43,840
[SPEAKER_00] A nije se javio.

1247
01:07:44,160 --> 01:07:46,800
[SPEAKER_00] Nije se javio, je li on načas, da se nije javio?

1248
01:07:46,880 --> 01:07:48,960
[SPEAKER_03] Krcili smo ga kod mene doma., pa.

1249
01:07:50,560 --> 01:07:51,920
[SPEAKER_03] Nisam ga krstili kod njega doma.

1250
01:07:52,560 --> 01:07:54,400
[SPEAKER_01] Ali smo ga krstili pošteno ako je išta.

1251
01:07:54,720 --> 01:07:55,120
[SPEAKER_01] Mafi.

1252
01:07:56,080 --> 01:07:57,600
[SPEAKER_01] U ovu kameru se prijetiš.

1253
01:07:59,200 --> 01:07:59,520
[SPEAKER_00] Noti.

1254
01:08:01,920 --> 01:08:03,280
[SPEAKER_00] Krtine, čovječe.

1255
01:08:03,440 --> 01:08:04,000
[SPEAKER_00] Krvistoga.

1256
01:08:06,480 --> 01:08:07,680
[SPEAKER_00] Drago mi je da je broda došao.

1257
01:08:08,400 --> 01:08:09,040
[SPEAKER_00] Znaš što je on žao?

1258
01:08:09,120 --> 01:08:10,400
[SPEAKER_00] Koji dio Dubrave je čisto veći.

1259
01:08:10,560 --> 01:08:11,040
[SPEAKER_01] Retkovec.

1260
01:08:11,680 --> 01:08:12,400
[SPEAKER_01] Da, Poljana.

1261
01:08:12,640 --> 01:08:14,240
[SPEAKER_01] Retkovec, Monteiro, Kvart.

1262
01:08:14,400 --> 01:08:15,040
[SPEAKER_00] Ali dobro, ajde.

1263
01:08:15,120 --> 01:08:16,480
[SPEAKER_00] Okej, ajde, Pegericić.

1264
01:08:17,120 --> 01:08:17,680
[SPEAKER_00] Grmicić, ma da.

1265
01:08:17,840 --> 01:08:19,680
[SPEAKER_03] Začega si išao po njemu, ali je zomrlim mrak.

1266
01:08:19,840 --> 01:08:20,960
[SPEAKER_03] Ja uče, to su neka uličica.

1267
01:08:21,360 --> 01:08:23,520
[SPEAKER_00] A da je moj kum živi, kad prođeš level tamo.

1268
01:08:23,680 --> 01:08:24,240
[SPEAKER_02] Da, je, je.

1269
01:08:25,360 --> 01:08:26,240
[SPEAKER_03] Dalje nećemo detalje.

1270
01:08:26,560 --> 01:08:28,800
[SPEAKER_00] Da, jasno, ali dobro, to je Retkovic.

1271
01:08:30,000 --> 01:08:31,360
[SPEAKER_00] Uglavnom, dobrodošli u kvart.

1272
01:08:32,160 --> 01:08:33,040
[SPEAKER_00] O kamatima.

1273
01:08:35,120 --> 01:08:36,080
[SPEAKER_00] I o nejavljanju.

1274
01:08:37,760 --> 01:08:40,800
[SPEAKER_00] Uglavnom, da, čisto smo se tog dotakli.

1275
01:08:41,200 --> 01:08:42,960
[SPEAKER_00] Nisam znao da je Dmla, je li?

1276
01:08:43,120 --> 01:08:43,440
[SPEAKER_00] Da, radio.

1277
01:08:43,840 --> 01:08:44,320
[SPEAKER_02] Nisam znao.

1278
01:08:45,120 --> 01:08:46,560
[SPEAKER_02] Ali Dmla je vano, jedina dva.

1279
01:08:46,800 --> 01:08:47,520
[SPEAKER_02] A zanimljiva stvar.

1280
01:08:48,240 --> 01:08:48,720
[SPEAKER_02] Osim flaua.

1281
01:08:49,040 --> 01:08:49,680
[SPEAKER_02] Sve ostalo je flow.

1282
01:08:49,920 --> 01:08:58,160
[SPEAKER_03] Sve ostalo je flow, a zanimljiva stvar što je on rekao da kao što je flow imao prste u tim drugim bitovima, zapravo mi smo odvana za sirene imali bit.

1283
01:08:58,560 --> 01:08:58,800
[SPEAKER_03] Aha.

1284
01:08:59,360 --> 01:09:00,720
[SPEAKER_03] Ali nama se sviđao.

1285
