[SPEAKER_02] Ima subway pored.

1355
01:13:22,560 --> 01:13:22,800
[SPEAKER_02] Se može.

1356
01:13:23,760 --> 01:13:24,800
[SPEAKER_00] O, ovo je samo prvo.

1357
01:13:24,880 --> 01:13:26,640
[SPEAKER_00] Ne, ne, ne.

1358
01:13:26,880 --> 01:13:27,680
[SPEAKER_00] Ova, bilo je.

1359
01:13:28,240 --> 01:13:29,520
